{"fields":[{"seq":1,"name_zh":"身分證字號","name_en":"ID","type":"Char","length":20,"description_zh":"經加密處理。國民身分證統一編 號，或外籍居留證號碼(若無居 留證號碼請填護照號碼)，左靠 不足補空白。","source":"承保 檔","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"national ID number","description_en":""},{"seq":2,"name_zh":"性別","name_en":"ID_S","type":"Char","length":1,"description_zh":"1:男性。 2:女性。","source":"承保 檔","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"gender","description_en":""},{"seq":3,"name_zh":"生日","name_en":"BIRTHDAY","type":"Num","length":8,"description_zh":"日期格式：yyyy-mm-dd。","source":"承保 檔","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"birthday","description_en":""},{"seq":4,"name_zh":"追蹤終點日","name_en":"END_DATE","type":"Num","length":8,"description_zh":"在資料擷取範圍內，有死亡紀錄 者，此欄位顯示為死亡日；無死 亡紀錄者，此欄位顯示資料擷取 終點(2023/12/31)，作為研究追蹤 終點日。 日期格式：yyyy-mm-dd。","source":"本檔 自訂","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"follow-up endpoint date","description_en":""},{"seq":5,"name_zh":"案件分類","name_en":"CASE_TYPE","type":"Char","length":2,"description_zh":"詳案件分類(CASE_TYPE)譯碼 說明。","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"Case Category","description_en":""},{"seq":6,"name_zh":"確診日","name_en":"INDEX_DATE","type":"Num","length":8,"description_zh":"若個案於資料起始日(2001/1/1) 前出生，確診日為資料起始日至 追蹤終點日(END_DATE)的隨 機日期；若個案於資料起始日後 出生，確診日為出生日至追蹤終 點日的隨機日期。 日期格式：yyyy-mm-dd。","source":"門住 診明 細檔","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"confirmed date","description_en":""},{"seq":7,"name_zh":"確診年","name_en":"INDEX_YEAR","type":"Num","length":8,"description_zh":"依據 INDEX_DATE 擷取年份作 為確診年(yyyy)。","source":"門住 診明 細檔","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"confirmed year","description_en":""},{"seq":8,"name_zh":"確診年齡","name_en":"INDEX_AGE","type":"Num","length":8,"description_zh":"(INDEX_DATE- BIRTHDAY)/365.25。 保留到小數點後2位。","source":"承保 檔、 門住 診明 細檔","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"age_at_diagnosis","description_en":""},{"seq":9,"name_zh":"確診年齡分組","name_en":"AGE_GROUP","type":"Char","length":1,"description_zh":"依據 INDEX_AGE 以 10 歲為一 單位分層(未超過30歲者除外)， 分為： 1:滿18歲未超過30歲 2:滿30歲未超過40歲 3:滿40歲未超過50歲 4:滿50歲未超過60歲 5:滿60歲未超過70歲 6:滿70歲未超過80歲 7:滿80歲未超過90歲","source":"本檔 自訂","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"","description_en":""},{"seq":10,"name_zh":"心肌梗塞","name_en":"CCI1","type":"Char","length":1,"description_zh":"0:無確診該疾病。 1:有確診該疾病。 (確診定義請見下方備註)","source":"門住 診明 細檔","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"myocardial infarction","description_en":""},{"seq":11,"name_zh":"心導管檢查","name_en":"ORDER1","type":"Char","length":1,"description_zh":"住院期間是否有相關支付代碼。 0：無；1：有。 (詳細編碼請參考附錄四)","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"cardiac catheterization","description_en":""},{"seq":12,"name_zh":"經皮冠狀動脈擴張術","name_en":"ORDER2","type":"Char","length":1,"description_zh":"住院期間是否有相關支付代碼。 0：無；1：有。 (詳細編碼請參考附錄四)","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"","description_en":""},{"seq":13,"name_zh":"冠狀動脈支架放置","name_en":"ORDER3","type":"Char","length":1,"description_zh":"住院期間同時有經皮冠狀動脈 擴張術及支架特材相關支付代 碼。0：無；1：有。 (詳細編碼請參考附錄四)","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"","description_en":""},{"seq":14,"name_zh":"葉克膜","name_en":"ORDER4","type":"Char","length":1,"description_zh":"住院期間是否有相關支付代碼。 0：無；1：有。 (詳細編碼請參考附錄四)","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"ECMO","description_en":""},{"seq":15,"name_zh":"心臟超音波檢查","name_en":"ORDER5","type":"Char","length":1,"description_zh":"住院期間是否有相關支付代碼。 0：無；1：有。 (詳細編碼請參考附錄四)","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"","description_en":""},{"seq":16,"name_zh":"低溫治療","name_en":"ORDER6","type":"Char","length":1,"description_zh":"住院期間是否有相關支付代碼。 0：無；1：有。 (詳細編碼請參考附錄四)","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"hypothermia therapy","description_en":""},{"seq":17,"name_zh":"去顫治療","name_en":"ORDER7","type":"Char","length":1,"description_zh":"住院期間是否有相關支付代碼。 0：無；1：有。 (詳細編碼請參考附錄四)","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"defibrillation treatment","description_en":""},{"seq":18,"name_zh":"冠狀動脈繞道手術","name_en":"ORDER8","type":"Char","length":1,"description_zh":"住院期間是否有相關支付代碼。 0：無；1：有。 (詳細編碼請參考附錄四)","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"","description_en":""},{"seq":19,"name_zh":"透析","name_en":"ORDER9","type":"Char","length":1,"description_zh":